{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "description": "Single sequential 1D tagging-bin classifier, derived by step3__make_1d_wps.py from tagger_config_ptincl.yml. Given jet pt and the configured tagger scores, returns the (floated) integer index of the exclusive tagging bin the jet falls in, following the same b -> c -> s style cascade used to derive the WPs -- implemented as nested/staggered 'binning' nodes (pt, then one axis per level), no formula node. Bin numbering starts at 0 on the first axis and increases through each subsequent axis, EXCEPT the cascade's terminal axis, whose bins are numbered in reverse (untagged/loosest bin first, tightest bin last). Mapping: 0=BT, 1=BL, 2=CT, 3=CL, 4=L, 5=SL, 6=SM, 7=ST.",
